      <h3 id="persistent-storage-csi-manila-dynamic-provisioning-console_persistent-storage-csi-manila" class="group scroll-mt-20">Dynamically provisioning Manila CSI volumes by using the web console<a href="#persistent-storage-csi-manila-dynamic-provisioning-console_persistent-storage-csi-manila" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h3>
      <p class="_abstract">To dynamically provision shared storage volumes using the OpenShift Container Platform web console, create a persistent volume claim (PVC) by selecting a Manila CSI storage class.</p>
      <p><strong>Prerequisites</strong></p>
      <ul><li>RHOSP is deployed with appropriate Manila share infrastructure so that it can be used to dynamically provision and mount volumes in OpenShift Container Platform.</li></ul>
